                    coach_intro:            `Two people are about to grill you: I challenge the ROI and the cost of the volunteering relaunch, and my colleague from the insurer wants hard evidence of "workforce stability" before they renew EUR 32M. The data already told you engagement varies more between managers than between sites — so don't fund eight things equally and tell me the score moved two points inside the margin of error. Show me where the signal is, prove it was you and not the labour market, and don't lose the purpose that the client and your people bought into in the first place.`,

