                    driver_pay:             `Pay & workload — the insurer team is simply underpaid and overloaded; everything else is noise`,
                    driver_score:           `The headline score — engagement fell 16 points company-wide; treat it as one uniform problem`,
                    segment_atrisk:         `The insurer at-risk team and the bottom-quartile manager cohort — where attrition and CSAT actually bite`,
                    segment_allstaff:       `All 2,100 staff equally — a company-wide perk so no one feels singled out`,
                    segment_topteams:       `The highest-engaged teams — reward the people already doing well to set an example`,
                    segment_newhires:       `New hires only — fix onboarding and the attrition fixes itself over time`,

                    r2_alloc_label:         `Allocate the EUR 1.8M one-off fund across the intervention menu (must total €1.80M).`,
                    r2_total_readout:       `Fund allocated:`,
                    r2_total_cap:           `/ €1.80M`,
                    r2_alloc_hint:          `The data rewards concentrating spend where the causal link is strongest. Eight initiatives at €0.225M each moved engagement 2 points — inside the survey's margin of error — and the board froze the recurring fund. Volunteering complements fixing pay/workload; it cannot substitute for it.`,
                    alloc_managers:         `Manager-capability programme — coach the bottom-quartile managers (the between-manager variance lever)`,
                    alloc_pay:              `Targeted pay & workload fix for the insurer flight-risk team`,
                    alloc_volunteer:        `Relaunch employer-sponsored volunteering (the lapsed flagship)`,
                    alloc_redesign:         `Job-redesign / autonomy pilots — more resources, less demand`,
                    alloc_recognition:      `Recognition & wellbeing supports — low-cost morale levers`,

                    r3_leading_label:       `Choose your primary LEADING indicator — the early signal the plan is working.`,
