                    r4_headline_label:      `The single headline metric you stake your credibility on.`,
                    r4_narrative_label:     `How do you reconcile the responsible-leadership story with the commercial case?`,
                    r4_cfo_label:           `The CFO challenges the cost of the volunteering relaunch. Your answer:`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you hold that an evidenced, integrated case beats a one-sided pitch? (%)`,
                    headline_retention:     `At-risk-team attrition cut to the ~25% benchmark — directly answers the client's stability condition`,
                    headline_engagement:    `Group engagement score back toward 74 — the leading indicator, framed as the proof point`,
                    headline_hours:         `Training hours and volunteering days delivered — show how hard the team worked`,
                    narrative_integrated:   `Both — engagement and responsibility ARE business strategy: retention savings AND the purpose that the client and staff bought into`,
                    narrative_costonly:     `Pure retention-savings case — strip the purpose story, the CFO only respects euros`,
                    narrative_purposeonly:  `Pure purpose story — lead with community and meaning, the numbers will follow`,
                    cfo_measured:           `It is a measured intervention with a tracked participation target and a link to retention — not a feel-good line item`,
                    cfo_brand:              `It is great for the employer brand and the award; trust me, it pays for itself`,
                    cfo_cut:                `Fair point — cut the volunteering entirely and put it all into pay`,

